## Interface: 16001
## Title: EveUI
## Notes: Sci-fi interface inspired by EVE Online: unit frames and cast bars (traditional or ring HUD), module racks, overview, fleet, Neocom, quest autopilot, combat text, damage meter, brackets, D-Scan, star map, fitting, skill queue, wallet, killmails, missions, fleet broadcasts, voice alerts, combat coach, faction themes and a full reskin.
